flowchart TD
    A[Developer pushes to main] --> B[GitHub repository]
    B --> C[GitHub Actions: Docker CI]
    C --> D[Checkout source]
    D --> E[Set up Node.js 22]
    E --> F[npm ci]
    F --> G[npm audit]
    G --> H[Build Docker image]
    H --> I[Trivy vulnerability scan]
    I -->|No HIGH or CRITICAL findings| J[Run container]
    J --> K[Health check: /health]
    K -->|Healthy| L[GHCR login with GITHUB_TOKEN]
    L --> M[Publish latest and short-SHA tags]
    I -->|Finding or scanner failure| X[Fail job; do not publish]
    K -->|Unhealthy| X

    B --> N[Jenkins CI]
    N --> O[Verify Node.js and npm]
    O --> P[Install dependencies]
    P --> Q[npm test]

    R[Pull request targeting main] --> S[Dependency Review workflow]
    S --> T[Review dependency changes]
